                        "review": "One of the funniest gay dating sims out there. Coming Out on Top knows how to balance being sexy, cute and truly cursed. The characters have a lot of personality, the dialogues are unhinged and made me cringe or laugh a bunch of times. The dateable men are very different from one another, the routes are very entertaining to do, even though not all of them were great for me. \r\n\r\nFavourites: Ian, Alex, Brad, Phil. \r\nWorst: Amos (what a random ahh route!).\r\n\r\nIf you are craving gay shenanigans, absolutely give this a try if you have the chance.",
